Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:27:23 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 019/144] GreatDANE: no TLS/QUIC session resumption, tickets,
 token cache or 0-RTT for chain hosts; fail closed if a chain host resumes
 anyway; TLSA response parser tolerates whitespace and HTTP/1.0 but rejects
 ambiguous replies

---
 netwerk/protocol/http/Http3Session.cpp        |  8 ++-
 .../manager/ssl/SSLServerCertVerification.cpp | 71 +++++++++++++++----
 .../manager/ssl/SSLServerCertVerification.h   |  5 ++
 security/manager/ssl/nsNSSCallbacks.cpp       | 14 ++++
 security/manager/ssl/nsNSSIOLayer.cpp         | 12 ++++
 5 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/netwerk/protocol/http/Http3Session.cpp b/netwerk/protocol/http/Http3Session.cpp
